9	/**
10	 * Encode a string as UTF-8 octets.
11	 *
12	 * Unpaired surrogates cannot survive a round trip through UTF-8, so they are
13	 * replaced with U+FFFD -- the same substitution the platform's own encoder
14	 * performs.
